         python3-mutagen
Description: Minimal modern MP3 player (GTK4 + Libadwaita + GStreamer)
 MET Music Player is a minimal MP3 player with drag-and-drop playlist,
 shuffle mode, seek bar and a live spectrum analyzer.
 Built on the system GTK4 + Libadwaita + GStreamer stack, no bundled
 libraries.
